      "message": "am i missing sth obvious?\n\n- voiceSelected holds TRUE when valid subId is present in preferred voice DB.\nThis is equivalently: defaultVoiceSub !\u003d INVALID_SUB\n\nvoiceSelected holds FALSE in two cases, 1) when user selected \"Always ask\" from UI,  2) When previously selected voice preferred subId becomes invalid.\nThis is equivalently: defaultVoiceSub \u003d\u003d INVALID_SUB\n\nthat\u0027s why i\u0027m saying:\nvoiceSelected \u003d (defaultVoiceSubId !\u003d SubscriptionManager.INVALID_SUBSCRIPTION_ID )\n check updateDefaultValue for more details.",
